            <profile id="9bb6-82f5-9c99-132e" name="Equipment and options (as printed in WAB2 army list)" publicationId="dab5-785d-be28-f228" hidden="false" typeId="b19e-ee0c-17d1-6e33" typeName="Equipment and Notes">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hand weapon, heavy armour, shield, thrusting spear, bow and horse. May have cloth or half barding (+4 pts). Eastern Shock Cavalry. Open Order. 0-1 unit of Pronija Retainers may be upgraded to Bodyguards (+3 pts), which count as Stubborn. The number of Pronija Retainer units may not be greater than the number of Provincial Pronija units. (Vlad the Impaler p.75)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile id="844b-844d-938a-3886" name="Armour Save" hidden="false" typeId="0dbe-f4ed-ef08-8e86" typeName="Armour Save">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Save" typeId="603e-2898-6af9-6cf1">4+</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="With conditional bonuses" typeId="5882-dd5a-bc28-4024">-</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="Notes" typeId="d5e4-804e-6192-0114">Armour save from armour, shield and barding bonus pips (rulebook pp.95-98); maximum 3+ (2+ for barded cavalry). M already includes encumbrance for armour/barding (p.96). Conditional pips are in the next column.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
              <!-- armour-save -->
            </profile>
          </profiles>
